    <string name="nova_safety_tips_body">Pause before you send. Screenshot and report threats. Block early — you never owe anyone access to you. In an emergency call 999.</string>
    <string name="nova_how_safe">How Nova Safe works</string>
    <string name="nova_how_safe_body">Nova Safe is rule-based and runs offline on your phone. It reads the words you are about to post, scores them, and can warn or block. It cannot understand sarcasm or context perfectly, and it does not read your private messages to other apps. Limits are real: determined evasion can slip through, so reporting still matters.</string>
